Version: 5.18.0
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: python3 (>= 3.10)
Description: AI-powered intelligent terminal with zero-trust safety
 NeuroShell unites a high-performance native C++20 terminal host with an
 intelligent Python AI daemon: natural-language command translation, 4-layer
 zero-trust safety validation, blast-radius previews, universal undo,
 kernel-level sandboxing, an MCP server mode, and verified signed
 self-updates.
